Subject: include sys/types.h in utils.h

utils.h casts to u_int32_t and u_int16_t, which glibc's stdlib.h
declares through sys/types.h and musl's does not. From Alpine main/cdparanoia.

--- cdparanoia-III-10.2.orig/utils.h
+++ cdparanoia-III-10.2/utils.h
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
+#include <sys/types.h>
 #include <stdlib.h>
 #include <endian.h>
 #include <stdio.h>
